# Claude Environment Creator - Context Exclusions
#
# These files are excluded from automatic context loading.
# Agents load what they need on demand via the Task tool.
# This keeps the orchestrator context lean per CLAUDE.md guidelines.

# Development artifacts (archived)
Docs/_archive/

# Large reference docs (loaded on demand by agents, not orchestrator)
Docs/Research/*.md
Docs/AgentGuidelines/Topics/*.md
Docs/AgentPlaybooks/*.md
Docs/Templates/**/*.md

# PDF files
*.pdf

